OL,3,AFour in court over murder of baby
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlovakian nationals Andrea Skopova, 20,
OL,7,Fformerly of Robey Street, Sheffield
OL,8,Fappeared at Sheffield Magistrates'
OL,9,FCourt alongside Peter Horvath, 19, Nina
OL,10,FHorvathova, 37 and Peter Horvath, 38,
OL,11,Fall of of Holywell Heights.
OL,13,FThey have been charged with murder,
OL,14,Fcausing or allowing the death of a
OL,15,Fchild and perverting the course of
OL,16,Fjustice by taking steps to conceal the
OL,17,Fkilling of an infant.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
